            <fr:route>/HIDN/</fr:route>
            <fr:title text="ReduceScatter is AllGather transposed">ReduceScatter is AllGather transposed</fr:title>
            <fr:taxon>Card</fr:taxon>
            <fr:meta name="anki">1786546735759</fr:meta>
            <fr:meta name="anki-deck">MLSys</fr:meta>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
  <html:p><fr:link href="/CAGW/" title="ReduceScatter" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/CAGW/" display-uri="CAGW" type="local">ReduceScatter</fr:link>: signature, relationship to <fr:link href="/VSDZ/" title="AllGather" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/VSDZ/" display-uri="VSDZ" type="local">AllGather</fr:link>, and cost?</html:p>
  
  
  
 <html:div class="jms-callout" style="
  margin: 1.1rem 0;
  padding: 0.1rem 0 0.1rem 0.9rem;
  border-left: 2px solid rgb(63, 83, 127);
  "><html:span style="font-weight: 500; color: rgb(63, 83, 127);" /> 
  <html:details><html:summary><html:span class="foldout" style="font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 500; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);">Answer</html:span></html:summary>
  <html:strong>Signature</html:strong> <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[[A, B]\{U_X\} \to  [A_X, B]]]></fr:tex> — it resolves partial sums along <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[X]]></fr:tex> and leaves the result <html:em>sharded</html:em> along a dimension of your choosing. It <html:em>introduces</html:em> a subscript, which is why you have to say where: <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathrm {ReduceScatter}_{X,K}]]></fr:tex>.

  <html:strong>Mechanism</html:strong>: the same ring pass as an AllGather, except you sum the incoming shards instead of keeping them. <html:strong>Cost</html:strong> is therefore identical, <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[V / W_{\mathrm {ici}}]]></fr:tex>.

  <html:strong>Duality</html:strong>: AllGather and ReduceScatter are transposes of each other, hence each other's derivative — an AllGather in the forward pass means a ReduceScatter on the reverse-mode gradients, and vice versa. (Broadcast is <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[u \otimes  I]]></fr:tex>, reduce is <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[u^\top  \otimes  I]]></fr:tex>.)
</html:details>
</html:div>



</fr:mainmatter>
